  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 404.13 Owner Liability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 404.13 Owner Liability. The owner of a UST facility may delegate responsibilities imposed by Env-Or 400 to an operator, but any such delegation shall not relieve the owner from liability for non-compliance with the requirements in this chapter.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-13; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (formerly Env-Or 404.13) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
